language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Choose the length of each of the 18 holes, each length being 3, 4 or 5, so that the total length of the course is 72.
$ holes[h] is the length of hole h
find holes : matrix indexed by [int(1..18)] of int(3..5)

such that
$ the total length of the course is 72
(sum h : int(1..18) . holes[h]) = 72
